# Antigravity Agent Configuration - JanCheck Module Guide

## Context & Project Structure
JanCheck is a civic accountability monorepo structured under:
- `src/core/`: Common types, shared utilities (`pinResolver`, `usePinSearch`), and hooks (`useWhatsAppShare`).
- `src/modules/`: 15 independent functional accountability modules.
- `docs/`: Technical specification markdown files defining the schemas, app flows, security, UI/UX tokens, and SEO rules for each module:
  - M1: [spec-m1-pincode-os.md](file:///d:/zaidsystem/02_Coding/01_Working/Project%20Info/docs/spec-m1-pincode-os.md)
  - M2: [spec-m2-state-cm.md](file:///d:/zaidsystem/02_Coding/01_Working/Project%20Info/docs/spec-m2-state-cm.md)
  - M3: [spec-m3-contractor-scorecard.md](file:///d:/zaidsystem/02_Coding/01_Working/Project%20Info/docs/spec-m3-contractor-scorecard.md)
  - M4: [spec-m4-budget-tracker.md](file:///d:/zaidsystem/02_Coding/01_Working/Project%20Info/docs/spec-m4-budget-tracker.md)
  - M5: [spec-m5-ration-welfare.md](file:///d:/zaidsystem/02_Coding/01_Working/Project%20Info/docs/spec-m5-ration-welfare.md)
  - M6: [spec-m6-hospital-checker.md](file:///d:/zaidsystem/02_Coding/01_Working/Project%20Info/docs/spec-m6-hospital-checker.md)
  - M7: [spec-m7-school-scorecard.md](file:///d:/zaidsystem/02_Coding/01_Working/Project%20Info/docs/spec-m7-school-scorecard.md)
